{title: 674 - Shalom}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #674 • SHALOM • 8.4.10.4}
{lyricist: Ancient Hebrew benediction}
{composer: Accomp. by Melvin West}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 674}
{meta: tune SHALOM}
{meta: meter 8.4.10.4}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]Shalom, my friends, [Gm/D]shalom, [Dm]my friends
[Am]Shalom, [Gm/D]shalom.
[Am]May [Dm]peace be with you, God’s peace be [Am]with you.
[Gm/D]Shalom, shalom.
{end_of_verse}
